*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Croco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
