==Strategy==
==='''Chapters 1 & 2'''===
Maawth outranges [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] and can kill her in four hits. By now, you should have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], so get rid of Maawth with him.

If you don't have Bahamut Cat, don't worry. You'll need a level 20 Valkyrie and the biggest [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] stack you can manage.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
You will need at least 4 meatshields to be able to stop the enemies' advance.

[[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] will help with the Scissoroos and LeMurr, while Bahamut Cat and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] will take care of the Maawth, in addition to helping against the rest of the enemies.

